<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6379" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάγραπτ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>recorded,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐεργεσία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.129
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Procop.Gaz.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				16
			</span></i>; <i>registered,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴς τινας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procop.
					<u>Vand.</u>
					2.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>rendered famous, immortalized,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Him.
				<u>Or.</u>
				15.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>marked with,</i> c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασιλείῳ
				συμβόλῳ, γράμμασιν ἱεροῖς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				4.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.11
			</span></i>; <i>painted,</i> in a picture, <i><span class="en">
				Chor.
			</span></i> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Philol.</u>
				54.111
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
